 "is_free": false,
 "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/9628e28fae11abed4733dccb0dd3ff43.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=718 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/9628e28fae11abed4733dccb0dd3ff43.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/9628e28fae11abed4733dccb0dd3ff43.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>关于游戏</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>在黑影下会变得扁平；在光明中则变得高耸。</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>照射让平面图形立体化(3D)；吸收让立体平面化(2D)。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是一款第一人称解谜游戏，献给那些仍然把传送枪、相机、视觉错觉解谜游戏收藏在游戏库的人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/7873e13af49c479247349358b6323e90.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/7873e13af49c479247349358b6323e90.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/7873e13af49c479247349358b6323e90.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/86ebdce893df1989576874decc7910dd.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/86ebdce893df1989576874decc7910dd.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/86ebdce893df1989576874decc7910dd.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>使用光照让影子获得「重量」。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一个平面方形展开，瞬间变成一座阶梯；看似脆弱的轮廓亦可以变成高耸的柱体。光赋予其重量、碰撞、重力——一旦转变成一个硬实的立体，你就能爬上去、推动它、让它堕落至某个地点。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/cafc526eb4bd16520ea210a352f22001.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/cafc526eb4bd16520ea210a352f22001.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/cafc526eb4bd16520ea210a352f22001.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>吸收光线，颠覆你认知的物理法则。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >原本在滚动的球突然停下来，墙壁亦可以变成一道通往前方的门。一旦物件的质量消失——原本阻碍你前进的障碍物，现在可以一一穿过。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/2b33a08ea37dacc82f040df317d63c1e.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/2b33a08ea37dacc82f040df317d63c1e.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/2b33a08ea37dacc82f040df317d63c1e.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>循序渐进，叠加扩展的游戏机制。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >镜射复制，透镜缩放，以融合的方式创造新的形态。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >三个篇章，五种机制环环相扣。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你愈深入探究，规则愈是交织。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >步步升级 ——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >拒绝盲目相加，唯有重组变化。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >三个篇章，游戏长度高达6小时以上，超过60种不同游戏关卡。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/396939ebf5ae59a81db850f07c6ca0c6.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/396939ebf5ae59a81db850f07c6ca0c6.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/396939ebf5ae59a81db850f07c6ca0c6.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>在背后默默注视着你解开一切的世界。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一位无名的「管理者」建造了这个追求完美无瑕的地方：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >大理石博物馆延伸到一条又一条仿佛无限重复的办公走廊，最后抵达一个黑白极简空间 —— 记忆从墙壁间渗漏而出。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >建筑本身就是第二道谜题——请务必仔细观察。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >请小心那些躲藏于黑影后的存在……</p>",
 "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>在黑影下会变得扁平；在光明中则变得高耸。</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>照射让平面图形立体化(3D)；吸收让立体平面化(2D)。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是一款第一人称解谜游戏，献给那些仍然把传送枪、相机、视觉错觉解谜游戏收藏在游戏库的人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/7873e13af49c479247349358b6323e90.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/7873e13af49c479247349358b6323e90.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/7873e13af49c479247349358b6323e90.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/86ebdce893df1989576874decc7910dd.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/86ebdce893df1989576874decc7910dd.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/86ebdce893df1989576874decc7910dd.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>使用光照让影子获得「重量」。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一个平面方形展开，瞬间变成一座阶梯；看似脆弱的轮廓亦可以变成高耸的柱体。光赋予其重量、碰撞、重力——一旦转变成一个硬实的立体，你就能爬上去、推动它、让它堕落至某个地点。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/cafc526eb4bd16520ea210a352f22001.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/cafc526eb4bd16520ea210a352f22001.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/cafc526eb4bd16520ea210a352f22001.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>吸收光线，颠覆你认知的物理法则。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >原本在滚动的球突然停下来，墙壁亦可以变成一道通往前方的门。一旦物件的质量消失——原本阻碍你前进的障碍物，现在可以一一穿过。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/2b33a08ea37dacc82f040df317d63c1e.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/2b33a08ea37dacc82f040df317d63c1e.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/2b33a08ea37dacc82f040df317d63c1e.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>循序渐进，叠加扩展的游戏机制。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >镜射复制，透镜缩放，以融合的方式创造新的形态。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >三个篇章，五种机制环环相扣。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你愈深入探究，规则愈是交织。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >步步升级 ——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >拒绝盲目相加，唯有重组变化。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >三个篇章，游戏长度高达6小时以上，超过60种不同游戏关卡。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/396939ebf5ae59a81db850f07c6ca0c6.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/396939ebf5ae59a81db850f07c6ca0c6.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/396939ebf5ae59a81db850f07c6ca0c6.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>在背后默默注视着你解开一切的世界。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一位无名的「管理者」建造了这个追求完美无瑕的地方：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >大理石博物馆延伸到一条又一条仿佛无限重复的办公走廊，最后抵达一个黑白极简空间 —— 记忆从墙壁间渗漏而出。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >建筑本身就是第二道谜题——请务必仔细观察。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >请小心那些躲藏于黑影后的存在……</p>",
 "short_description": "这是一款以光重塑物理与几何的第一人称解谜游戏。为那些仍然在游戏库里保留着「传送枪、相机、以及视觉错觉」的玩家，献上一场充满异常和错乱现象的神秘旅程。",
 "supported_languages": "英语, 韩语, 日语, 简体中文, 繁体中文, 法语, 意大利语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 丹麦语, 乌克兰语, 俄语, 印度尼西亚语, 土耳其语, 希腊语, 波兰语, 泰语, 瑞典语, 芬兰语, 荷兰语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西",
 "reviews": "“Like Portal and The Talos Principle, this game features solid puzzle mechanics that enable interaction with distant objects.”<br>Jeep Barnett - Portal developer<br>",
